msgid "Always on top"
msgstr "最上層顯示"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1657
msgid "Show Winamp in taskbar"
msgstr "在工作列中顯示 Winamp"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1660
msgid "Mini player"
msgstr "迷你播放器"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1664
msgid ""
"Use classic Winamp .wsz skins. Press Ctrl+M or click the skin logo to "
"return. Drop a skin on either window to add it."
msgstr ""
"使用經典的 Winamp .wsz 面板。按 Ctrl+M 或按一下面板標誌即可返回。將面板拖放到"
"任一視窗即可新增。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1668
msgid ""
"Use classic Winamp .wsz skins. Press Cmd+Shift+M or click the skin logo to "
"return. Drop a skin on either window to add it."
msgstr ""
"使用經典的 Winamp .wsz 面板。按 Cmd+Shift+M 或按一下面板標誌即可返回。將面板"
"拖放到任一視窗即可新增。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1674
msgid "Skin"
msgstr "面板"

#. Translators: {folder} is the path of the skins folder.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1678
#, rust-format
msgid "Installed skins are in {folder}. Find more at the Winamp Skin Museum."
msgstr "已安裝的面板位於 {folder}。可在 Winamp Skin Museum 找到更多面板。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1683 src/ui/winamp/mod.rs:714
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1684
msgid "Whole-number scaling keeps skin pixels sharp."
msgstr "以整數倍縮放可讓面板像素保持清晰。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1689
msgid "Keep the Winamp window above everything else."
msgstr "讓 Winamp 視窗一律顯示在其他視窗之上。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1695 src/ui/winamp/mod.rs:737
msgid "Show in taskbar"
msgstr "在工作列中顯示"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1698
msgid ""
"Keep a taskbar button for the mini player. The tray icon stays available "
"when hidden."
msgstr "在工作列中保留迷你播放器的按鈕。隱藏後仍可使用系統匣圖示。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1703
msgid "Installed skins"
msgstr "已安裝的面板"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1716
msgid "Switch to it"
msgstr "切換至此面板"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1729
msgid "Skin Museum"
msgstr "Skin Museum"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1755
msgid "Random"
msgstr "隨機"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1794
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Now showing {skin}. Another one is picked each time the mini player opens."
msgstr "目前外觀：{skin}。每次開啟迷你播放器都會換一個。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1850
msgid "MilkDrop window"
msgstr "MilkDrop 視窗"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1858
msgid ""
"A projectM visualiser for local playback. Open it here, from the top bar, "
"with Ctrl+Shift+K, or from the mini player's V menu. Press ? or F1 for its "
"shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"用於本機播放的 projectM 視覺效果。可從這裡、頂端列、按 Ctrl+Shift+K 或透過迷"
"你播放器的 V 選單開啟。按 ? 或 F1 查看快捷鍵。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1862
msgid ""
"A projectM visualiser for local playback. Open it here, from the top bar, "
"with Cmd+Shift+K, or from the mini player's V menu. Press ? or F1 for its "
"shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"用於本機播放的 projectM 視覺效果。可從這裡、頂端列、按 Cmd+Shift+K 或透過迷你"
"播放器的 V 選單開啟。按 ? 或 F1 查看快捷鍵。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1868 src/ui/settings.rs:2047
msgid "Presets"
msgstr "預設集"

#. Translators: {folder} is the path of the MilkDrop presets folder.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1873
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"None yet in {folder}. Add .milk files here. Siphon downloads presets when "
"MilkDrop first opens with an empty folder."
msgstr ""
"{folder} 中還沒有預設集。請將 .milk 檔案加入這裡。第一次開啟 MilkDrop 時若資"
"料夾是空的，Siphon 會下載預設集。"

#. Translators: {folder} is the path of the MilkDrop presets folder.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1879
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"One preset in {folder}. Add .milk files here. Siphon downloads presets when "
"MilkDrop first opens with an empty folder."
msgstr ""
"{folder} 中有 1 個預設集。請將 .milk 檔案加入這裡。第一次開啟 MilkDrop 時若資"
"料夾是空的，Siphon 會下載預設集。"

#. Translators: {count} is the number of presets, {folder} the path of the MilkDrop presets folder.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1885
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{count} preset in {folder}. Add .milk files here. Siphon downloads presets "
"when MilkDrop first opens with an empty folder."
msgid_plural ""
"{count} presets in {folder}. Add .milk files here. Siphon downloads presets "
"when MilkDrop first opens with an empty folder."
msgstr[0] ""
"{folder} 中有 {count} 個預設集。請將 .milk 檔案加入這裡。第一次開啟 MilkDrop "
"時若資料夾是空的，Siphon 會下載預設集。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1894
msgid "Time per preset"
msgstr "每個預設集的時間"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1897
msgid "How long each preset plays before the next fades in."
msgstr "每個預設集播放多久後再淡入下一個。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1905
msgid "Lower rates use fewer resources. Uncapped draws as fast as possible."
msgstr "影格速率越低，使用的資源越少。「不限制」會盡可能快速繪製。"

#. Translators: {hz} is the screen's refresh rate in hertz.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1910
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Your screen refreshes at {hz} Hz. Higher rates do not add visible frames. "
"Uncapped draws as fast as possible."
msgstr ""
"你的螢幕更新頻率為 {hz} Hz，更高的速率不會增加可見的影格。「不限制」會盡可能"
"快速繪製。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1917
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "解析度"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1920
msgid "Half and Quarter use fewer resources and scale the image back up."
msgstr "「一半」和「四分之一」使用較少資源，並會將畫面放大顯示。"

